  "phasen.fahrer.durchsuchung.cop": "Open the boot, please.",
  "phasen.fahrer.durchsuchung.nicht": "Don't hold the door, boot or bag shut.",
  "phasen.fahrer.durchsuchung.tipp": "Keep your hands visible, don't touch anything, don't obstruct.",
  "phasen.fahrer.ende.cop": "Stay in the car for a moment.",
  "phasen.fahrer.ende.nicht": "Don't ask \"am I under arrest?\" – it sounds dramatic.",
  "phasen.fahrer.ende.tipp": "After the check, save the video with \"Save copy now\".",
  "phasen.fahrer.fragen.cop": "Where are you coming from? Have you had anything to drink today?",
  "phasen.fahrer.fragen.nicht": "\"Just one glass\", \"two hours ago\" – the most common mistake.",
  "phasen.fahrer.fragen.tipp": "First your details, then this sentence. Polite, without explanations.",
  "phasen.fahrer.massnahme.cop": "Then we'll just take blood. Come with us.",
  "phasen.fahrer.massnahme.nicht": "Don't pull away or run – otherwise you also risk a criminal case for resistance.",
  "phasen.fahrer.massnahme.tipp": "Blood test, phone seizure, the station: object with words, not with your body.",
  "phasen.fahrer.papiere.cop": "Driving licence and vehicle registration, please.",
  "phasen.fahrer.papiere.nicht": "Don't cite legal sections while handing them over – it sounds rehearsed.",
  "phasen.fahrer.papiere.tipp": "Hand over your driving licence and vehicle registration calmly and without a word. No legal sections needed here.",
  "phasen.fahrer.start.cop": "Good evening, routine traffic check.",
  "phasen.fahrer.start.nicht": "Don't reach into the glove compartment or a bag without warning first.",
  "phasen.fahrer.start.tipp": "Turn on the interior light, roll down the window, hands on the wheel. Speak slowly.",
  "phasen.fahrer.tests.cop": "Blow into this, please.",
  "phasen.fahrer.tests.nicht": "Don't agree just \"to get it over with faster\".",
  "phasen.fahrer.tests.tipp": "If the officer insists: ask whether it's an order.",
  "phasen.fuss.ausweis.cop": "Your ID, please.",
  "phasen.fuss.ausweis.nicht": "Don't explain where you're going and why – that already counts as a statement about the matter.",
  "phasen.fuss.ausweis.tipp": "Give your personal details and show your ID if you have it with you – nothing more.",
  "phasen.fuss.durchsuchung.cop": "Empty your pockets, please.",
  "phasen.fuss.durchsuchung.nicht": "Don't empty your pockets yourself – that can look like consent.",
  "phasen.fuss.durchsuchung.tipp": "Keep your hands visible, don't hold onto anything, don't obstruct.",
  "phasen.fuss.ende.cop": "Stay standing here.",
  "phasen.fuss.ende.nicht": "Don't just walk away while it's unclear whether the check is over.",
  "phasen.fuss.ende.tipp": "After the check, save the video with \"Save copy now\".",
  "phasen.fuss.grund.cop": "This is just a routine check.",
  "phasen.fuss.grund.nicht": "Don't argue about whether the check is fair.",
  "phasen.fuss.grund.tipp": "Remember the officer's answer – the video is running.",
  "phasen.fuss.massnahme.cop": "You're coming with us to the station now.",
  "phasen.fuss.massnahme.nicht": "Don't pull away or run – otherwise you also risk a criminal case for resistance.",
  "phasen.fuss.massnahme.tipp": "Station, photos, fingerprints: object with words, not with your body.",
  "phasen.fuss.start.cop": "Good day, police. ID check.",
  "phasen.fuss.start.nicht": "Don't reach into bags or a backpack without warning first.",
  "phasen.fuss.start.tipp": "Stop, hands out of your pockets, speak slowly.",
  "phasen.label.ausweis": "ID",
  "phasen.label.durchsuchung": "Search",
